+# Satisfiable precondition witnesses
+
+These are ground instances of every entry claim. Map keys not shown are absent.
+
+## `prime-loop`
+
+- `L = 1`, `N = 5`, `D = 2`, `B = true`, `REST = .Map`,
+  `SC = 0 |-> scope(.Map, parent(-1))`, `P = parent(0)`, `K = .K`.
